- Seven unique enemies\n- Three castable spells\n- Three ultimate abilities\n- Three main levels\n- An endless mode", "short_description": "A magic themed VR tower defense game. Face off against hordes of monsters as they descend upon you in waves. Place towers, cast spells, make quick getaways, and unleash total destruction to clear your path of all that comes against you! Features three main levels with increasing progression of enemies, spells, and towers to use as well as an unlockable endless mode."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QBOO29Isr98s23pcXoUxCqxdCCGNfhdm8Nza00Z21uk/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "tpiszar", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EHl6CAHWxbM", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "275629210202852"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29644283315162719"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1284973585935646"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1284973585935646"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1745346120, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1284973585935646"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "3152022177423552